OL,3,GNEWSAKingspan fined bB,40m for
OL,4,Acompetition breach
OL,5,
OL,6,FKingspan, the Irish building materials
OL,7,Ffirm, has been fined bB,40m (#33.9m) by
OL,8,Fthe European Commission for providing
OL,9,Fit with incorrect and misleading
OL,10,Finformation during a competition
OL,11,Finvestigation.
OL,13,FIn 2021 Kingspan planned to take over
OL,14,FTrimo, a rival manufacturer of
OL,15,Finsulating panels.
OL,17,FThat required an investigation under
OL,18,FEuropean Union (EU) merger rules to
OL,19,Fmake sure it would not lead to
OL,20,Fsignificantly reduced competition.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
